shield of idiots

447
00:21:36,448 --> 00:21:38,792
(改變吧 在妳被迫改變之前)
Change before you have to

448
00:21:39,526 --> 00:21:41,407
(外表很重要)
Appearances matter

449
00:21:44,364 --> 00:21:46,876
(然後不要忘記妳的笑容)
and remember to smile

450
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:53,678
(微笑)

451
